    "rounds": 2,
    "match": "fair",
    "gaps": "Critic fixes applied: cream cast-iron shaft with plate rings and rust streaks, rust gallery with open white rail, taller glazed lantern with white cap and vane, upper windows, whitewash gable keeper house with green roof, picnic pavilion, pale limestone ground, white fence, broadleaf trees. Taper kept slimmer than critic's 8.6 m base (OSM ring is the platform, photos show a slender tower). Trees still lollipop shaped, not wind-bent casuarinas; no thatch roof."
